WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.266
Hi! Last year, I traveled to New York. Listen to the E D sounds!

2
00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:12.592
I arrived on a Friday night. Times Square was so bright!

3
00:00:13.042 --> 00:00:16.386
Arrived, arrived: a D sound.

4
00:00:18.636 --> 00:00:21.608
Every morning, I walked in Central Park.

5
00:00:22.058 --> 00:00:27.027
Walked, walked: a T sound. No new syllable!

6
00:00:29.277 --> 00:00:33.317
I visited museums. I wanted to see everything!

7
00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:39.990
Visited, wanted: these verbs end in T, so we say I D.

8
00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.327
On Saturday, I danced at a party with new friends.

9
00:00:46.777 --> 00:00:49.842
Danced, danced: a T sound.

10
00:00:52.092 --> 00:00:56.411
I loved New York! Loved: a D sound.

11
00:00:56.861 --> 00:00:59.786
And you? Tell me about your last trip!

